<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder up on growth outlook.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder up on growth outlook.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd rose 5.3 percent, or 1.25 rupees, to 24.75 on turnover of 600 shares, as investors predicted good results for the quarter to September 30, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are bullish on the share since tea prices have been at record highs this year,&quot; said a retail broker.</p>
<p>A further quantity of 50,000 shares was on bid at six rupees.</p>
<p>The company processes tea bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (41) 434319</p>
